    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eccf6ba3b68abfcb0bfb0968",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟东海帝王的交集拓展了她的视野。\n然而，调查的结果\n却让她意识到两面巨大高墙的存在──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07495c310fdc3e8fa534a102b4d551ec6f538ce818b5be86a7b32d1ef5eb21a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078419.json",
      "json_path": [
