    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3e4f72cd6837a45346a84e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉在“短途马锦标”\n展现了优秀的表现。\n比赛后，她和东海帝王见面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90fc7bafb1b550bc47d75ca20a61e428b7302136ac19bce190171228af11d174",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
