    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e44d40c51f53be3508d9d5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着提议一起参加彼此崇拜的两位“皇帝”\n都没能获胜的“天皇赏（秋）”，\n在那里一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faf1bda15427ace51808b2fee96e050bbd7052ed121e55123bb927dadc33c157",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaf06f8875adf6774a26860",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1122b388b756ff3a336fc9f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，也文摄辉的最终目标\n就决定是明年的“天皇赏（秋）”了。\n也正因如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b23e8ac5264901e09215402fef0accf92da7adc2bac5ccdfccfef5ad2f4eaa3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db40fc55e0484d3e99f244f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d840b2fcfeb0b87eeaa5977e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "必须先称霸短距离、英里路线。\n下一个目标就是“英里CS”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7636bdb6a8e76a4d6ca05a545788212ef0458cf120799d8963e8056a63cf5396",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ebac255785b8b3cbb19fa8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短途马锦标结束后・和金风决战",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e9ec870aa6c15887f8304fd0a5560e872f6b8d128c755f67506fd8acd8c79c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0494ab5a8b57f375733b86b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078421.json",
      "json_path": [
