    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001d058240dac7f7efc8775f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而却不能一直沉浸在喜悦中。\n紧接着就是下一个目标，“称霸三阶级”的\n第二战──短距离战“短途马锦标”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d8ee71d97cc37c9ccdfaa019cab64358d54a4aa7db983dc150597716acd81c1",
