      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉准备挑战\n连“英里皇帝”也没能达成的伟业。\n训练员则是希望成为她更大的助力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "68bc9a3b1b1c06f82155f907b21cb4faca1feb8ecfde14b6d1de0e3c0a7d14c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
